{"id":"ec9751f6536e0aa8","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbpolar.md","title":"极性Posiform与实值polar函数","display":"df-pbpolar — 极性Posiform与实值polar函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbpolar","aliases":["27-df-pbpolar"],"display":"df-pbpolar — 极性Posiform与实值polar函数","depends_on":["[[27-df-pbnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"13.6.4, Definition 13.15","source_printed_pages":"604","source_pdf_pages":"628","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbpolar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbpolar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbpolar — 极性Posiform与实值polar函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"13.6.4, Definition 13.15"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"604"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"628"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"34c60c3bc15859dd\" href=\"?note=34c60c3bc15859dd\" title=\"27-df-pbnf\">27-df-pbnf</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n:\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k=\\varnothing\\lor B_k=\\varnothing)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n:\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k=\\varnothing\\lor B_k=\\varnothing)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P):P\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P):P\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个非常数项内部只允许同一极性；不同项可以使用不同极性。常数表示也合法。这与Boolean函数方程章节的polar类须按对象类型区分，不能凭名字复用接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pbnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pbnf","status":"resolved","id":"34c60c3bc15859dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbnf]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Posiform}_n,\\mathrm{PBEval}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\n\\{(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{Posiform}_n:\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k=\\varnothing\\lor B_k=\\varnothing)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{PBEval}_n(P):P\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1305,"backlinks":[{"id":"18018df5c235cd7a","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$。$\\mathrm{PBAlmostPositive}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbalmostpositive]]，$\\mathrm{PBPolar}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbpolar]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbpolar|df-pbpolar — 极性Posiform与实值polar函数]]"},{"id":"90beadd9d7ce40a3","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$P=(b_0,(b_k,A_k,B_k)_{k=1}^m)\\in\\mathrm{PBPolarForms}_n$（[[27-df-pbpolar]]），$E_P$ 见 [[27-df-pbposiconflict]]。"}],"outgoing":["34c60c3bc15859dd"]}